---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Yeshiva Ketana of Queens Annual Dinner | Attention Earned"
  description="One call. Five weeks. Eight videos. Full-campaign execution for YKQ's annual dinner — featuring honoree videos, teasers, and a student-shot school day film."
>

  <article class="ykq">

    <!-- ── Hero ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <header class="ykq__hero container">
      <p class="ykq__eyebrow">Case Study &nbsp;·&nbsp; Nonprofit &nbsp;·&nbsp; Annual Dinner</p>
      <h1 class="ykq__title">They'd seen our work.<br>They just didn't know if we could do it at scale.</h1>
      <p class="ykq__sub">One call. Five weeks. Eight videos. This is what full-campaign execution looks like.</p>
    </header>

    <!-- ── Meta strip ────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="ykq__meta container">
      <div class="ykq__meta-item">
        <span class="ykq__meta-label">Client</span>
        <span class="ykq__meta-value">Yeshiva Ketana of Queens</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ykq__meta-item">
        <span class="ykq__meta-label">Timeline</span>
        <span class="ykq__meta-value">Five weeks</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ykq__meta-item">
        <span class="ykq__meta-label">Deliverables</span>
        <span class="ykq__meta-value">8 videos + motion graphics</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ykq__meta-item">
        <span class="ykq__meta-label">Distribution</span>
        <span class="ykq__meta-value">Email, WhatsApp, School Website</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ── Featured video ───────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="ykq__featured container">
      <span class="ykq__group-label">Start Here</span>
      <p class="ykq__group-title">The School Day, Unfiltered</p>
      <div class="ykq__video-frame ykq__video-frame--featured">
        <video
          src="https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/scl/fi/23tlhdz7tfjga5s1o2463/v3.4-Student-video-from-their-eyes-6.10-4.30-pm-dc-hq.mp4?rlkey=cxwov6ngep16jjml2pw7rn1sb&dl=1"
          controls
          preload="auto"
          playsinline
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ── Dinner videos ─────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="ykq__video-section container">
      <div class="ykq__video-group">
        <p class="ykq__group-label">Dinner Videos</p>
        <div class="ykq__grid ykq__grid--3">

          <div class="ykq__tile">
            <video src="https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/scl/fi/ibhbbueiu27gl5rnnp080/1.-Khiyayev-v3-6.10.26-12-pm-hq.mp4?rlkey=ef02jw6a4yipcfrttjw0gev11&dl=1" controls preload="auto" playsinline />
            <span class="ykq__tile-label">Khiyayev</span>
          </div>

          <div class="ykq__tile">
            <video src="https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/scl/fi/nx6affuoqyunj0q3yn1p8/2.-v3.6.Herman-Dinner-video-6.10.26-320-pm.mp4?rlkey=qinincwyknt3klhusx0sam95x&dl=1" controls preload="auto" playsinline />
            <span class="ykq__tile-label">Herman</span>
          </div>

          <div class="ykq__tile">
            <video src="https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/scl/fi/9cdd1v0vqknfgqmwugc62/3.-Rabbi-Dovid-Kurz-v3-.5-.10.-26-33pm-hq.mp4?rlkey=yzvw1iggxgzypl5abhdqgfgn1&dl=1" controls preload="auto" playsinline />
            <span class="ykq__tile-label">Rabbi Dovid Kurz</span>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ── Teasers ──────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
      <div class="ykq__video-group">
        <p class="ykq__group-label">Teasers</p>
        <div class="ykq__grid ykq__grid--4">

          <div class="ykq__tile">
            <video src="https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/scl/fi/24vx8s4ab9j0olenjwbdp/Herman-teaser-landscape-v5-5.29.26.mp4?rlkey=4icc981xlpnzsjuv10d5ayr3s&dl=1" controls preload="auto" playsinline />
            <span class="ykq__tile-label">Herman Teaser</span>
          </div>

          <div class="ykq__tile">
            <video src="https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/scl/fi/5py7nhtwhfwtlsji9zenv/v2.6-Baruch-Khiyayev-teaser-1241-pm-6.5.26-dc-landscape.mov?rlkey=eosgi1div8s948rhr600cb59t&dl=1" controls preload="auto" playsinline />
            <span class="ykq__tile-label">Khiyayev Teaser</span>
          </div>

          <div class="ykq__tile">
            <video src="https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/scl/fi/0tf2liushw06wy5ce41u9/Rabbi-Kurz-landscape-Teaser-YKQ-v3-9-pm-5.31.26.mp4?rlkey=afgmp5nbmnndu3ncaevnziqi4&dl=1" controls preload="auto" playsinline />
            <span class="ykq__tile-label">Rabbi Kurz Teaser</span>
          </div>

          <div class="ykq__tile">
            <video src="https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/scl/fi/k15uk9zrz8sp2zjoypgpe/Pre-Chag-teaser-v3-dc-1123.mp4?rlkey=b69b4yhla9yq6dtxs4hahbr03&dl=1" controls preload="auto" playsinline />
            <span class="ykq__tile-label">Pre-Chag Teaser</span>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="ykq__rule container" />

    <!-- ── Copy ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="ykq__copy container">

      <div class="ykq__copy-block">
        <span class="ykq__eyebrow">The Brief</span>
        <h2>They had a dinner coming up and a story worth telling.<br>No content to show for either.</h2>
        <p>YKQ came to us having already seen what we make. The concern wasn't quality. It was scope. Could we deliver a full multi-video campaign, or just one good piece?</p>
        <p>We had five weeks from that call to find out.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ykq__copy-block">
        <span class="ykq__eyebrow">The Approach</span>
        <h2>Most schools make one video about how great they are. We made four.</h2>
        <p>Each one hits a different angle. Each one stands on its own. All of them build the same case.</p>
        <ul class="ykq__list">
          <li>A father who came from Russia, got his Jewish education here in America, and now sends his son to the best school he knows</li>
          <li>A head of guidance moving on, and <em>what his chapter said about how this school treats kids</em></li>
          <li>A stair rebbi with so many great lines <em>we had a hard time choosing</em></li>
          <li>The school day, unfiltered. <em>Shot entirely by the students themselves</em></li>
        </ul>
        <p>Together they're not a video series. <em>They're a sales deck that doesn't feel like one.</em></p>
      </div>

      <div class="ykq__copy-block">
        <span class="ykq__eyebrow">The Surprise</span>
        <h2>The best piece wasn't planned.</h2>
        <p>Before Shavuos we stumbled on students singing and dancing in the hallway. We had a camera. That's all it took.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ykq__copy-block">
        <span class="ykq__eyebrow">The Moment</span>
        <h2>There's nothing quite like watching grown men cry at a dinner video.</h2>
        <p>That's what happened when the lights went down. These aren't tearjerker pieces. They're honest ones. When you get the story right, that's what it does to people who lived it.</p>
        <p>That's what we're actually making.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ykq__copy-block">
        <span class="ykq__eyebrow">The Result</span>
        <h2>Eight videos. Five weeks. Delivered where it counts.</h2>

        <div class="ykq__stats">
          <div class="ykq__stat">
            <span class="ykq__stat-n">8</span>
            <span class="ykq__stat-desc">Videos delivered</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ykq__stat">
            <span class="ykq__stat-n">5</span>
            <span class="ykq__stat-desc">Weeks start to finish</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ykq__stat">
            <span class="ykq__stat-n">4</span>
            <span class="ykq__stat-desc">Long-form pieces</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ykq__stat">
            <span class="ykq__stat-n">4</span>
            <span class="ykq__stat-desc">Teasers</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p>Distributed via email, WhatsApp, and the school website. The people who needed to see it saw it before they walked in the door. By the time the dinner started, the room was already primed.</p>
        <p>And while guests were arriving, a 22-minute B-roll montage played on the reception room screens. Not a slideshow. Not stock photos. Real footage of real school life, cut to hold attention. Every touchpoint of the evening was elevated. Goodbye slideshow.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </article>

  <CtaBand
    heading="Ready to tell a cohesive story across all your messaging?"
    accentPhrase=""
    primaryLabel="Start your project"
    primaryHref="/contact"
  />

</Base>

<style>
  /* ── Layout shell ───────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ykq {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-9);
  }

  /* ── Hero ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ykq__hero {
    padding-block: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 7rem) var(--space-7);
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .ykq__eyebrow {
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-soft);
    font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }

  .ykq__title {
    font-size: var(--fs-display-xl);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display);
    color: var(--text-strong);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }

  .ykq__sub {
    font-size: var(--fs-body-lg);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  /* ── Meta strip ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ykq__meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    padding-block: var(--space-5) var(--space-7);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .ykq__meta-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-soft);
    font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .ykq__meta-value {
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    color: var(--text-strong);
    font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
  }

  /* ── Video shared ───────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ykq__group-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-soft);
    font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .ykq__group-title {
    font-size: var(--fs-h2);
    font-weight: var(--fw-black);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
    color: var(--text-strong);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  /* ── Featured video ─────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ykq__featured {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-6);
    max-width: 960px;
  }

  .ykq__video-frame {
    background: var(--surface-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ykq__video-frame video {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  /* ── Video grid section ─────────────────────────────────── */
  .ykq__video-section {
    max-width: 960px;
    padding-bottom: var(--space-7);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .ykq__grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.625rem;
  }

  .ykq__grid--3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  .ykq__grid--4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }

  .ykq__tile {
    background: var(--surface-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ykq__tile video {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ykq__tile-label {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem;
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(251, 248, 241, 0.6);
    background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(11, 10, 9, 0.75));
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* ── Divider ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ykq__rule {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    max-width: 960px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-7);
  }

  /* ── Copy ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ykq__copy {
    max-width: 900px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .ykq__copy-block {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-7);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-7);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .ykq__copy-block:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .ykq__copy-block h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 2.8vw, 2.3rem);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display);
    color: var(--text-strong);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
    max-width: 700px;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .ykq__copy-block p {
    font-size: var(--fs-body-lg);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .ykq__copy-block p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .ykq__copy-block p em {
    color: var(--text-body);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* ── List ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ykq__list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: var(--space-5) 0;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .ykq__list li {
    font-size: var(--fs-body-lg);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    padding: var(--space-3) 0 var(--space-3) var(--space-5);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    position: relative;
  }

  .ykq__list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .ykq__list li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 1.1rem;
    width: 6px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
  }

  .ykq__list li em {
    color: var(--text-body);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* ── Stats ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .ykq__stats {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-7);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: var(--space-5) 0 var(--space-6);
  }

  .ykq__stat-n {
    display: block;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: var(--fw-black);
    color: var(--accent-soft);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .ykq__stat-desc {
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    color: var(--text-faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
  }

  /* ── Responsive ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .ykq__grid--3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .ykq__grid--4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .ykq__stats   { gap: var(--space-5); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 400px) {
    .ykq__grid--4 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
